WEBVTT

01:30.980 --> 01:35.990
We don't use glasses merely as a vision
correction tool or a fashion accessory (...)
That is our Glasses Club.

01:42.690 --> 01:44.400
Hey, you guys!

01:45.130 --> 01:46.360
Chatter Chatter

01:45.340 --> 01:46.370
That's...

01:47.050 --> 01:48.620
The Glasses Club!

01:55.330 --> 01:56.890
Let me ask you this!

01:56.890 --> 01:58.640
Chatter Chatter

02:00.580 --> 02:02.960
Would you like to see a beautiful lady...

02:03.690 --> 02:05.610
...naked?!

02:07.000 --> 02:09.410
And do you want to see it
without her realizing it,

02:10.590 --> 02:13.340
or getting mad at you?!

02:15.920 --> 02:18.550
The time has come for
our dream to be fulfilled!

02:20.530 --> 02:21.450
Come forth!

02:21.650 --> 02:24.140
The super machine that,
just by putting it on,

02:24.140 --> 02:25.870
makes the whole world see-through!

02:35.500 --> 02:38.380
X-Ray Glasses Mk. 33!

02:38.860 --> 02:41.920
Transform!

02:52.070 --> 02:54.440
Now, activate!

03:03.170 --> 03:05.320
Another failure.

03:06.400 --> 03:07.930
Don't give up, Glasses Club!

03:07.930 --> 03:08.960
Keep fighting!

03:11.450 --> 03:13.960
For the dream of men all over the world!

03:14.110 --> 03:32.600
Glasses Club! Glasses Club!

03:16.290 --> 03:17.600
You guys...

03:21.680 --> 03:24.640
The passion that you hold
for X-Ray Glasses...

03:25.600 --> 03:26.480
I will...

03:26.690 --> 03:27.720
No...

03:27.720 --> 03:29.360
We of the Glasses Club will...

03:29.630 --> 03:32.600
See it realized!

03:36.350 --> 03:37.760
If only...

03:38.780 --> 03:40.950
they would've gotten all worked up like that,

03:40.950 --> 03:43.290
it sure would have been fun!

03:43.000 --> 03:44.250
Club President
Soma Akira

03:43.290 --> 03:44.250
Right?

03:52.280 --> 03:53.160
Glasses!

03:55.540 --> 04:01.380
I get worked up just being by
your side, Soma-senpai!

04:02.150 --> 04:03.380
Club Member
Kamatani Mitsuki

04:03.380 --> 04:07.020
Me too! Me too! I agree with Mitsuki!

04:07.020 --> 04:09.190
Being with you is fun, President!

04:12.320 --> 04:14.810
Don't hop on the bandwagon. It's annoying.

04:14.810 --> 04:16.810
Club Member (Provisional)
Kimata Hayato

04:19.940 --> 04:22.350
The connection here is faulty.

04:22.730 --> 04:25.780
Minabe-senpai, you really know your stuff.

04:26.210 --> 04:27.270
I suppose.

04:26.550 --> 04:28.280
Club Member
Minabe Yukiya

04:28.740 --> 04:30.950
Listen to what I'm saying, you guys!

04:31.170 --> 04:32.790
You too, Takuma!

04:32.790 --> 04:34.460
Wake up!

04:41.930 --> 04:44.020
You caught me sleeping, huh?

04:42.400 --> 04:44.380
Club Member
Hachimine Takuma

04:44.540 --> 04:45.530
Jeez...

04:46.880 --> 04:50.460
Entry Forbidden!
Reserved for Glasses Club!

04:47.100 --> 04:48.480
What's this?

04:48.990 --> 04:50.080
Packing tape?!

04:50.760 --> 04:52.230
Glasses Club?

04:52.490 --> 04:54.300
Do we have a club like that?

04:54.300 --> 04:57.850
Do we even have that many guys
who wear glasses at our school?

04:58.450 --> 04:59.730
Yeah, you're right.

05:00.740 --> 05:03.820
No-Glassers [no-glahs-erz]

05:00.740 --> 05:03.820
1. People who don't wear glasses.

05:00.740 --> 05:03.820
2. A derogatory term used by those who wear glasses
to describe those who don't. "This is why I hate ____!"

05:00.830 --> 05:03.040
This is why I hate No-Glassers.

05:03.820 --> 05:07.120
They don't understand the greatness
of glasses at all, do they?!

05:07.480 --> 05:10.310
You know, I'm starting to realize

05:10.310 --> 05:14.230
that our Glasses Club is really
just like air to them.

05:14.230 --> 05:17.700
It's like no one even realizes we're here.

05:18.890 --> 05:20.370
Two of them?!

05:20.370 --> 05:21.500
Kids, please don't try this at home.

05:22.520 --> 05:24.760
A guy who can't pick up on the mood
in the air shouldn't talk about being air.

05:22.520 --> 05:24.760
Waaaaugh!

05:25.510 --> 05:26.730
Enough!

05:27.840 --> 05:31.500
Brilliant inventions and
sublime works of art

05:31.910 --> 05:34.540
are never appreciated right away.

05:35.370 --> 05:36.770
That said, what is this place?

05:36.770 --> 05:39.770
Extremely Spacious Roof

05:38.130 --> 05:41.370
Doing such delicate
construction work outside...

05:45.620 --> 05:47.220
...is really hard, after all.

05:47.220 --> 05:50.530
We don't have a choice.
We lost our club room.

05:51.540 --> 05:53.780
Glasses Club

05:56.090 --> 05:59.310
The only thing true to life about
the president's daydream

05:59.310 --> 06:00.810
was the explosion part.

06:01.100 --> 06:01.680
Ah.

06:01.680 --> 06:04.100
Oh! You finished it, Yukiya?

06:04.100 --> 06:06.720
The X-Ray Glasses Mk. 34 are—

06:06.650 --> 06:13.720
Gaaaah...

06:06.720 --> 06:09.370
My X-Ray Glasses Mk. 34!

06:09.130 --> 06:13.720
Nooooo...

06:09.370 --> 06:12.530
My exquisite cream puff custard!

06:12.530 --> 06:13.730
<i>That's</i> what you're upset about?!

06:16.720 --> 06:18.220
Exquisite Cream Puff Custard

06:16.890 --> 06:17.910
Sweet.

06:18.350 --> 06:22.720
Hey! My X-Ray Glasses Mk. 34!

06:24.420 --> 06:26.060
We'll have to start from scratch.

06:26.060 --> 06:27.470
Shock...

06:31.940 --> 06:35.360
Soma-senpai! I know just how you feel!

06:35.680 --> 06:37.260
You can cry if you want!

06:37.260 --> 06:40.320
Cry into my chest! As much as you like!

06:41.150 --> 06:43.620
We don't use glasses merely as
a vision-correction tool

06:43.620 --> 06:45.480
or a fashion accessory.

06:45.480 --> 06:48.700
We attack them from a broader
perspective of worldwide relevancy.

06:48.700 --> 06:52.300
We push glasses to the limits
of their glorious potential.

06:52.300 --> 06:53.690
That is our Glasses Club.

06:54.160 --> 06:57.270
But, what is this state
we've found ourselves in?!

06:57.280 --> 07:02.020
Glasses Club

06:57.700 --> 06:59.340
Our club room was taken from us.

06:59.340 --> 07:02.020
Actually, we blew that up ourselves.

07:02.020 --> 07:05.300
Ideal

07:02.240 --> 07:04.970
Our members can't agree on anything.

07:03.610 --> 07:05.800
Reality

07:04.970 --> 07:08.060
Nah, we've always been like that.

07:08.060 --> 07:09.540
Hayato is annoying.

07:09.540 --> 07:11.210
But it's all the truth!!!

07:09.540 --> 07:11.210
I'm the only one getting dissed?!

07:11.960 --> 07:14.100
And all because our club's
budget is so low.

07:14.100 --> 07:16.370
No, it's almost nothing!

07:16.370 --> 07:18.310
I see! So that's it!

07:18.310 --> 07:19.880
I think you're exactly right!

07:19.880 --> 07:21.330
Brilliant as ever, President!

07:22.370 --> 07:25.510
Listen, men. We must
swear to one another.

07:25.510 --> 07:26.480
Yes!

07:27.130 --> 07:29.600
No matter what it takes,

07:29.600 --> 07:32.160
our Glasses Club must create
the X-Ray Glasses that can

07:32.160 --> 07:33.940
see through all inanimate objects.

07:33.940 --> 07:34.930
Yes!

07:35.150 --> 07:37.330
And once our club has
something to show for itself,

07:37.330 --> 07:39.780
we will naturally receive
an increased club budget!

07:39.780 --> 07:40.930
Yes!

07:41.060 --> 07:43.020
Glasses!

07:42.060 --> 07:44.220
That cream puff is very good.

07:43.230 --> 07:45.700
Glasses!

07:44.220 --> 07:45.700
I know, right?

07:45.700 --> 07:47.190
X-Ray Glasses
(Glasses that can see through inanimate objects.)

07:46.090 --> 07:47.200
X-Ray!

07:51.570 --> 07:52.950
Anyway...

07:52.950 --> 07:54.320
Vision Test

07:54.970 --> 07:59.080
2-E Homeroom Teacher
Glasses Club Advisor

07:54.970 --> 07:59.080
Shirogane Hotaka

07:55.160 --> 07:57.790
Tomorrow morning we'll be
holding a vision test.

08:01.080 --> 08:03.200
What did you just say, Shirogane?

08:03.590 --> 08:06.000
That's "Mr. Shirogane."

08:06.000 --> 08:08.660
You said a vision test?

08:09.210 --> 08:13.480
Those of you who usually
wear contacts, or glasses,

08:13.480 --> 08:16.810
make sure you bring them with you.

08:18.700 --> 08:20.250
What a pain.

08:20.250 --> 08:23.430
Well, we get to ditch class, that's lucky.

08:23.430 --> 08:25.690
Let's just do it and get it over with.

08:29.350 --> 08:30.340
All members assemble!

08:32.050 --> 08:33.900
It's a vision test!!!

08:32.800 --> 08:33.900
This is a significant event for glasses-
wearers, and for our Glasses Club, too!

08:33.900 --> 08:34.740
I wonder if my vision's gotten worse~

08:34.750 --> 08:35.950
For the Glasses Club, too?
What are you talking about, Akira?

08:35.950 --> 08:37.070
I'll explain later!! Just assemble
on the roof at once!!!!

08:37.090 --> 08:38.080
Gotcha!

08:38.100 --> 08:38.700
Roger that!

08:38.700 --> 08:39.350
Entry Forbidden!
Reserved for Glasses Club!

08:41.040 --> 08:42.450
It's come! The vision test!

08:43.810 --> 08:45.040
At long last.

08:45.570 --> 08:49.550
Every year during the vision test,
a doctor comes from outside the school.

08:47.790 --> 08:48.340
Doctor

08:49.800 --> 08:51.220
Which means...

08:51.220 --> 08:56.520
The kind of Venus you never see around
our pigsty of an all-boys technical school!

08:56.520 --> 08:58.260
Doctor

08:56.520 --> 08:58.260
Venus

08:58.700 --> 09:03.230
She'll probably bring a cute
female nurse to assist her, too.

09:03.230 --> 09:03.870
Venus

09:03.230 --> 09:04.970
Doctor

09:03.870 --> 09:04.970
Nurse

09:05.460 --> 09:06.410
In other words...

09:06.410 --> 09:07.900
Doctor

09:06.410 --> 09:07.900
Nurse

09:08.370 --> 09:10.650
We can test out the X-Ray Glasses!

09:13.890 --> 09:16.970
The vision test is the paradise!

09:17.460 --> 09:21.760
If we don't X-Ray tomorrow,
when else <i>will</i> we X-Ray?!

09:24.260 --> 09:27.420
We'll show them what the
Glasses Club is made of!

09:30.670 --> 09:31.640
Yeah!

09:31.640 --> 09:33.120
No matter what it takes,

09:33.120 --> 09:36.330
we've got to finish the X-Ray Glasses
Mk. 34 before tomorrow!

09:36.330 --> 09:37.550
Yeah!

09:45.330 --> 09:48.370
Yukiya! Connect those
two parts completely!

09:45.660 --> 09:50.650
Flash of insight!

09:45.660 --> 09:50.650
Bam!

09:48.370 --> 09:49.570
Roger that.

09:48.750 --> 09:51.630
Rumble

09:49.570 --> 09:52.300
Takuma! Get him lots of screws!

09:52.300 --> 09:53.680
Okaaay!

09:54.030 --> 09:55.070
Mitsuki! The sweat!

09:55.070 --> 09:55.710
Okay!

09:55.710 --> 09:57.940
No, not me! Wipe off Yukiya's sweat!

09:58.250 --> 10:03.560
Grab

09:58.940 --> 10:01.510
Why are you wiping him with my clothes?

10:00.350 --> 10:04.540
Rub
Rub

10:01.510 --> 10:03.420
Oh, you're "wiping" with my "clothes," right?

10:02.220 --> 10:02.720
Fuku (clothes)

10:02.720 --> 10:04.540
Fuku (clothes)              Fuku (to wipe)

10:03.650 --> 10:04.450
Hayato!

10:04.060 --> 10:10.020
Hayato!

10:04.450 --> 10:05.280
Yes, sir!

10:05.280 --> 10:06.140
You're annoying!

10:05.600 --> 10:10.020
You're
annoying!

10:06.140 --> 10:06.850
Yes, sir!

10:06.850 --> 10:08.030
Wait... Hey!

10:07.480 --> 10:09.960
Shock...

10:27.260 --> 10:30.170
Why? Why isn't it finished?

10:30.170 --> 10:31.100
President!

10:31.100 --> 10:32.120
What is it, Hayato?

10:32.120 --> 10:34.180
I didn't say anything this whole time,

10:34.180 --> 10:37.970
but the truth is, I can't read
Yukiya-senpai's blueprints.

10:37.970 --> 10:39.730
Neither can I!

10:39.730 --> 10:43.840
So that's why you kept moving
the soldering iron around.

10:43.840 --> 10:45.750
I was pretending to help!

10:48.530 --> 10:50.110
Is it because we're stupid?

10:50.110 --> 10:53.500
Our deviation value is -10, after all.

10:56.520 --> 10:59.960
Then it's all about spirit.
The love of glasses!

11:02.280 --> 11:05.730
We have love and passion on our side!

11:07.710 --> 11:09.800
That's right, Soma-senpai!

11:09.800 --> 11:12.800
We still have time!
As long as we don't sleep!

11:13.280 --> 11:14.800
I'm used to working all night.

11:14.800 --> 11:17.740
If we get tired, we can eat cream puffs.

11:18.780 --> 11:22.980
Let's build our X-Ray Glasses
and see that nurse lady naked!

11:23.250 --> 11:25.220
Yeah!

11:50.260 --> 11:52.040
Just one hour left.

11:53.010 --> 11:55.420
Let's just give up already.

11:55.420 --> 11:57.760
Yeah, it's not possible.

11:57.760 --> 11:59.230
That's right.

11:59.230 --> 12:02.520
No matter what we do,
we can't make them in an hour.

12:02.740 --> 12:04.810
In reality, we have even less time.

12:04.810 --> 12:07.740
We have to take the vision test, too.

12:13.580 --> 12:17.330
If we give up, then the
X-Ray Glasses die here.

12:19.640 --> 12:21.530
We have two hours and
thirty minutes left

12:22.300 --> 12:26.260
until the vision test ends
and the nurse goes home.

12:27.680 --> 12:31.930
We're still in the game, until the vision test ends and the nurse goes home.

12:32.440 --> 12:33.770
Before that happens,

12:34.020 --> 12:36.280
we <i>will</i> complete the X-Ray Glasses!

12:43.530 --> 12:44.860
I will explain your mission!

12:44.860 --> 12:49.320
Gym                       School Building

12:45.320 --> 12:47.800
First, when your turn comes
to take the vision test,

12:47.800 --> 12:49.330
buy as much time as you can.

12:50.780 --> 12:54.690
Gym                                  School Building

12:51.180 --> 12:53.800
Meanwhile, those not taking the vision test

12:53.800 --> 12:56.040
will stay on the roof and
work on the X-Ray Glasses.

12:54.690 --> 13:04.460
School Building

12:56.040 --> 12:57.580
The minute you finish the vision test,

12:57.580 --> 13:00.170
proceed to the roof and
begin work immediately.

13:00.170 --> 13:04.460
We'll repeat until the X-Ray
Glasses Mk. 34 are complete!

13:05.820 --> 13:06.760
Damn it!

13:07.820 --> 13:09.980
If only we had our old Glasses Club room,

13:09.980 --> 13:11.930
we'd be right next to the gym.

13:12.500 --> 13:15.650
Going back and forth from here to
the gym is going to take too long!

13:18.620 --> 13:22.990
Umm. Hmm. That's...

13:23.120 --> 13:27.490
Nu... ha... ha... maybe?

13:29.220 --> 13:32.520
Right eye, 0.4, left eye 1.0, it seems.

13:32.520 --> 13:36.530
Now, we'll test you with your glasses on.

13:36.530 --> 13:37.500
Okay!

13:39.140 --> 13:44.400
Umm. Hmm. That's...

13:44.400 --> 13:49.010
Ki... ho... ho. I think.

13:51.800 --> 13:54.170
Can you really see this?

13:56.020 --> 13:57.020
Glasses!

13:57.230 --> 13:59.440
What was your vision last time?

13:59.440 --> 14:01.530
2.0 in both eyes!

14:02.280 --> 14:04.480
But, you wear glasses, don't you?

14:04.480 --> 14:06.780
Yes! Fake ones for looks!

14:10.070 --> 14:10.930
What?

14:11.780 --> 14:12.790
Glasses!

14:13.450 --> 14:15.660
You really are stupid!

14:15.660 --> 14:18.660
Tromp tromp tromp...

14:15.860 --> 14:18.260
Even though you wear fake glasses,
Soma-senpai took pity on you

14:18.260 --> 14:20.450
and let you join the glasses club
as a provisional member!

14:18.670 --> 14:19.420
Only glasses-wearers are allowed
to become full members.
-Glasses Club

14:19.420 --> 14:23.380
Tromp tromp tromp...

14:20.450 --> 14:23.380
So you could at least
be a little useful...

14:26.370 --> 14:29.240
You didn't buy them any time at all!

14:29.240 --> 14:30.730
Yeah, but...

14:31.480 --> 14:37.100
Tromp tromp tromp...

14:31.790 --> 14:35.600
Wait, huh? Am I still just
a provisional member?

14:35.600 --> 14:37.100
Of course you are!

14:41.120 --> 14:43.160
The first years are finished!

14:48.040 --> 14:48.930
Good.

14:50.240 --> 14:53.110
We just finished step 3 on the blueprint.

14:53.110 --> 14:56.960
If you need the soldering iron,
I left it by the entrance.

14:58.970 --> 15:01.890
Soma-senpai's so cool.

15:01.890 --> 15:04.760
Don't just stand there! Let's do it!

15:05.250 --> 15:08.180
We're running out of time
before our turn! Hurry!

15:08.430 --> 15:10.510
This way will be faster!

15:15.980 --> 15:20.180
I'm afraid I don't have
that kind of athletic ability...

15:20.670 --> 15:21.700
But...

15:25.600 --> 15:30.240
Pitter-pat, pitter-pat...

15:26.550 --> 15:30.060
I'll show you the power of bare feet!

15:30.240 --> 15:32.900
I'll reduce my wind resistance,
if only by a little!

15:38.750 --> 15:41.250
0.01 in both eyes.

15:41.250 --> 15:43.510
Now, put your glasses on, please.

15:50.260 --> 15:54.520
Unghhh...

15:52.120 --> 15:54.230
You can just say them if you want.

15:57.420 --> 16:02.100
Got a cramp, huh? That must hurt.

16:02.210 --> 16:03.110
Glasses.

16:04.760 --> 16:06.120
I'm gonna head back.

16:06.120 --> 16:07.200
We're counting on you!

16:15.840 --> 16:18.920
I'll try reducing wind resistance even further.

16:26.920 --> 16:29.870
Right 0.2, left 0.4.

16:29.870 --> 16:32.060
Next, with your glasses on, please.

16:36.240 --> 16:40.140
By the way, doctor, did you know?

16:40.930 --> 16:44.140
The French term for "cream puff"
is "choux à la crème."

16:44.140 --> 16:47.200
But if you went to America and said
"Choux à la crème, please,"

16:47.200 --> 16:50.160
they'd think you were
asking for "shoe cream."

16:50.570 --> 16:52.840
What? What are you talking about?

16:52.840 --> 16:55.740
Let me tell you more about cream puffs.

16:55.880 --> 16:56.740
Glasses.

16:56.840 --> 16:59.010
Vision is 0.03 in both eyes.

16:59.490 --> 17:02.760
Ah, Soma-kun. I see they've
gotten worse since last year.

17:02.970 --> 17:03.840
Yes, sir!

17:03.840 --> 17:07.040
Try walking forward until you can see it.

17:07.160 --> 17:08.640
Right away, sir!

17:12.440 --> 17:14.760
You have to get that close to see it?

17:15.160 --> 17:16.060
No, sir!

17:16.400 --> 17:17.270
Glasses!

17:19.010 --> 17:22.050
This cart is awesome! We're moving now!

17:22.210 --> 17:24.440
Soma-kun, 45 degree turn to the right!

17:24.440 --> 17:26.440
We'll take the turn at top speed!

17:40.060 --> 17:42.130
How are the X-Ray Glasses
Mk. 34 coming?!

17:55.210 --> 17:56.920
Soma-senpai...

17:57.410 --> 17:58.810
President...

18:00.660 --> 18:01.800
It's...

18:03.420 --> 18:04.680
no good, then?

18:19.090 --> 18:20.300
This is...

18:23.890 --> 18:26.140
Looks like they finished them!

18:43.120 --> 18:45.730
We did it! We did it!

18:46.130 --> 18:48.610
Our X-Ray Glasses Mk. 34!

18:49.200 --> 18:50.950
They're finished!

18:56.340 --> 18:58.860
X-Ray! X-Ray!

18:59.550 --> 19:07.120
Assistant: Hariu Kyosuke

19:02.140 --> 19:05.010
Mr. Shirogane, what are those voices?

19:05.010 --> 19:07.120
Probably the Glasses Club guys.

19:07.390 --> 19:09.530
They're making quite a lot of noise.

19:09.530 --> 19:11.140
Did something happen?

19:11.140 --> 19:15.130
Probably just something silly again.
Leave them be, Kyosuke.

19:15.460 --> 19:16.700
Are you sure?

19:16.700 --> 19:18.200
I'm sure.

19:18.200 --> 19:20.640
Kids will enjoy themselves like kids do.

19:20.640 --> 19:23.690
If anything happens,
I'll take responsibility for it.

19:24.270 --> 19:28.130
Although, it will be an
incredible pain in the ass.

19:30.340 --> 19:33.160
We can still make it! Let's go, boys!

19:33.160 --> 19:36.900
A beautiful nurse's naked
body is waiting for us!

19:37.100 --> 19:38.530
Yeah!

19:46.160 --> 19:47.280
Soldering iron?

19:52.250 --> 19:54.420
President! I'll help you!

20:06.260 --> 20:07.490
I've got a bad feeling.

20:08.700 --> 20:10.100
You don't think...

20:11.340 --> 20:12.770
...it's going to explode.

20:17.900 --> 20:19.290
Those little punks...

20:25.390 --> 20:26.680
I'm back!

20:30.600 --> 20:32.330
Welcome back, Akira-kun.

20:33.960 --> 20:36.710
Soma Hikaru

20:41.410 --> 20:43.030
Thanks, Hikaru.

20:50.500 --> 20:54.110
So listen, we had a vision
test at school today...

20:54.380 --> 20:56.820
They said there'd be a
pretty nurse lady there.

20:56.820 --> 20:59.440
So I swore we'd finish the
X-Ray Glasses in time.

21:00.160 --> 21:01.970
So you didn't finish them, in the end?

21:02.450 --> 21:06.910
Nah. But failure is the bridge to success!

21:08.050 --> 21:12.200
So? What was the pretty nurse lady like?

21:12.200 --> 21:13.960
Pretty Nurse Lady

21:17.840 --> 21:20.260
Now that you mention it,
I didn't see a nurse lady there!

21:20.260 --> 21:21.750
Just the old guy.

21:20.260 --> 21:21.750
There's a lot
of strange kids
here today.

21:20.260 --> 21:21.750
Doctor!

21:24.820 --> 21:27.580
What's that? So it was all for nothing?

21:28.120 --> 21:30.660
No, it wasn't all for nothing!

21:30.660 --> 21:33.130
We'll complete them some day!

21:33.130 --> 21:34.620
The X-Ray Glasses!

21:37.230 --> 21:38.150
Sure!

23:11.710 --> 23:13.380
Glasses are a galaxy.

23:11.920 --> 23:12.570
Glasses

23:12.590 --> 23:13.240
Galaksy    =      Glasses

23:13.240 --> 23:16.500
Galaxy    =      Glasses

23:13.380 --> 23:17.640
They are an eternal power that unlocks
a new world when you've lost your way!

23:16.500 --> 23:20.250
<b>Eternal Power!!</b>                        Galaxy    =      Glasses

23:17.640 --> 23:20.690
I will give you the name of one star
that dwells in that galaxy.

23:17.990 --> 23:20.320
You're so cool!

23:18.310 --> 23:20.390
That's our president!

23:18.640 --> 23:20.440
Soma-kun, you're awesome!

23:20.690 --> 23:22.330
The framework that supports the glasses.

23:22.330 --> 23:24.300
Its name: temple!

23:23.350 --> 23:24.300
Temple

23:24.300 --> 23:25.910
No Glasses, No Life

23:30.600 --> 23:33.010
Tomorrow's fortune for wearers
of half under rim glasses:

23:33.920 --> 23:35.880
I might not be as great as Soma-senpai,

23:35.880 --> 23:38.130
but I have a feeling I'll
meet someone wonderful!
